<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="how we work" id="s1"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2950" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="HOW WE WORK&#10;start bottom-left, follow the arrows" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="15" width="260" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="AGREED" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="85" width="110" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="STILL OPEN" style="rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ff8c00;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="180" y="85" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="STEP 1  —  CLOSED 21 Sep&#10;&#10;THE IDEA FACTORY&#10;24/7 on the VM. No human input." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#9673a6;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="145" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="1.  TRADINGVIEW      ← start here&#10;&#10;Pull public scripts. Strip each one&#10;to what it actually DOES.&#10;&#10;200 scripts that are all RSI are&#10;ONE idea, not 200." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="250" width="260" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="2.  THE BOT INVENTS ITS OWN&#10;&#10;When TradingView runs dry, it keeps&#10;generating ideas by itself.&#10;&#10;It never stops and never waits." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="415" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="3.  KRIS INJECTS A SOURCE&#10;&#10;Any time he wants. Optional.&#10;Not required for the loop to run." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="560" width="260" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="DEDUPE  →  QUEUE&#10;&#10;• tried it already?  skip&#10;• same idea, new name?  skip&#10;&#10;One at a time. Runs for days." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="685" width="260" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="1st&#10;NEXT IDEA&#10;FROM THE QUEUE" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#2d6a4f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="CLOSED. The queue fills itself&#10;and never repeats.&#10;&#10;TradingView → bot invents →&#10;Kris can add a source anytime.&#10;&#10;Runs unattended, 24/7." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="2nd&#10;BUILD IT SAFELY" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1f1f1f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="Turn the idea — a Pine script, a&#10;paper, the bot's own idea — into&#10;code our engine can run.&#10;&#10;THE MOST DANGEROUS STEP.&#10;The translator must physically&#10;be unable to read future bars.&#10;&#10;No maths downstream can catch&#10;a leak. A planted cheat scored&#10;perfect on every single check." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="3rd&#10;QUICK CHECK&#10;CLOSED 22 Sep" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1f1f1f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="Seconds. Four questions about&#10;TRADES. Any no = dead.&#10;&#10;1  Enough trades?&#10;     0.4 a day AND 100 total&#10;&#10;2  Beats costs?&#10;     profit at NORMAL fees&#10;&#10;3  One lucky run?&#10;     delete its best 5 trades&#10;&#10;4  The idea, or the drift?&#10;     beat random entry&#10;&#10;factory/check.py &#183; 13 tests" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="285" width="195" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="4th&#10;TEST EVERYWHERE&#10;3 YEARS" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1f1f1f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="Hours. EVERY market, EVERY&#10;timeframe. 6 x 4 = 24 tests.&#10;&#10;Learn on 1 year → trade the next&#10;3 months blind → repeat.&#10;&#10;Never sees the future.&#10;Pays real costs, 1x 2x 3x.&#10;&#10;If only ONE of the 24 works,&#10;that is fine. Keep it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="5th&#10;LUCK CHECK" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1f1f1f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="Run the SAME test on a&#10;scrambled version with no&#10;information in it.&#10;&#10;If the fake scores the same,&#10;we found nothing." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="6th&#10;RE-CHECK ON&#10;5 YEARS" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#2d6a4f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1650" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="KRIS'S RULE, AND IT IS WHAT&#10;MAKES STEP 4 SAFE.&#10;&#10;Same rule, longer history.&#10;&#10;Do NOT skip it. It removes&#10;98% of the junk that gets&#10;through by luck." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1650" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="7th&#10;RUN THE&#10;EVALUATION" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#2d6a4f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1900" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="Two numbers. Nothing else:&#10;&#10;• PASS %&#10;• DAYS TO PASS&#10;&#10;8% target, 3% daily cap,&#10;6% total cap.&#10;&#10;Want: 1-3 weeks, high %." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1900" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="8th&#10;TRADE IT" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#1f1f1f;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2150" y="145" width="195" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value="• the rule we actually trade&#10;• a TradingView indicator&#10;• a paper bot running live&#10;• then real prop accounts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2150" y="285" width="195" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n17" target="n19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n19" target="n21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n21" target="n23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="next idea" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#9673a6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="DIES HERE&#10;&#10;Most ideas.&#10;Seconds each." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="530" width="195" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="DIES HERE&#10;&#10;No better than&#10;a scrambled version." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="530" width="195" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" value="DIES HERE&#10;&#10;Looked good on 3 years,&#10;fell apart on 5.&#10;That was luck." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1650" y="530" width="195" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" value="WHAT WE TRADE&#10;&#10;Test on ALL: gold, silver, Bitcoin,&#10;EUR GBP JPY  x  15m 1h 4h 1d." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="15" width="340" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n37" value="WHAT WE PAY TO TRADE&#10;&#10;Gold 1.6 · silver 9 · crypto 14&#10;(round trip, basis points)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="15" width="320" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n38" value="WHAT HAS ACTUALLY WORKED HERE&#10;&#10;Every winner came from a NEW DATA FEED,&#10;never a new way of drawing price." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="15" width="360" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" value="THE PRIZE&#10;&#10;Pass evaluations fast, and often.&#10;Nothing else matters yet." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510" y="15" width="300" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" value="THE SCORE     —  only two numbers" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#82b366;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="10" width="470" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" value="PASS %     —  how often we get funded&#10;DAYS        —  how long it takes when we do&#10;&#10;That is the whole scoreboard.&#10;&#10;NOT profit factor: it is highest for a tight stop&#10;that wins 5% of the time and pays huge — the&#10;worst thing to take into a 3% daily cap.&#10;&#10;NOT trades per day: more trades only looked&#10;faster because a blown account was free." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="70" width="470" height="195" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="THE ONE DIAL:  RISK PER TRADE&#10;&#10;Bigger size = fewer days AND lower pass %.&#10;Smaller size = more days AND higher pass %.&#10;&#10;So every candidate gets a CURVE, not a number.&#10;We read both numbers off it and choose.&#10;&#10;This is arithmetic on a fixed set of trades, not&#10;searching, so it is always allowed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="285" width="470" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="STILL OPEN&#10;&#10;Where on that curve do we want to sit?&#10;&#10;Fastest? Highest pass %? Somewhere between?&#10;&#10;Cannot be answered until we see a real curve&#10;from a real candidate. Park it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ff8c00;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="485" width="470" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n44" value="WHY TESTING 24 CELLS IS SAFE     —  tested 21 Sep" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#d6b656;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="665" width="470" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="Trying 24 combinations and keeping any that works&#10;gives luck 24 chances. That is a real risk.&#10;&#10;Junk strategies reaching the desk, per 1,000 tested:&#10;&#10;    3 years only .................  31&#10;    3 years + the 5-year re-check   0.5&#10;&#10;STEP 6 REMOVES 98% OF IT. Test everywhere all you&#10;like — but never skip the 5-year check." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="720" width="470" height="185" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n46" value="STEP 3, MEASURED ON 45 GENERATED IDEAS — gold 1h, 22 Sep&#10;&#10;all ideas ........................................  45&#10;... makes money at normal fees ...........  19&#10;... survives deleting its best 5 trades ...  19&#10;... BEATS RANDOM ENTRY ................    5&#10;&#10;THE DRIFT CHECK IS THE ONE WITH TEETH. Gold rose 123% in the window, so 14 of those 19 &quot;winners&quot; were just gold going up — every one of them scored WORSE than entering at random.&#10;&#10;It does not ban trading with a trend: all 5 survivors are long gold too. It bans trading one worse than random." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="655" width="890" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n47" value="FIXED 21-22 Sep&#10;&#10;The generator could only&#10;build smooth signals — it&#10;could not say &quot;when X&#10;spikes&quot;, which is what our&#10;one working strategy is.&#10;&#10;The factory grammar now&#10;has cross-above and&#10;cross-below, which fire on&#10;one bar and are silent&#10;otherwise.&#10;&#10;factory/spec.py" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1330" y="655" width="250" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" value="THE LEDGER&#10;&#10;Not for raising any bar —&#10;the bar never moves.&#10;&#10;It is there to stop us&#10;testing the same idea&#10;twice." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="655" width="250" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" value="PARKED FOR NOW&#10;&#10;What a funded account&#10;earns, and whether to buy&#10;several evaluations at once.&#10;&#10;Kris: focus on passing&#10;first. Agreed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ff8c00;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1930" y="655" width="250" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>